{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the labyrinthine depths of Veilwalkers, where survival is a desperate dance with madness and monsters. As a recruit for a shadowy government agency, you must explore these meticulously handcrafted dungeons to uncover powerful artifacts. These artifacts serve as the currency of this dark world, allowing you to upgrade equipment and enhance your deck. Gameplay revolves around strategic deck-building and item usage. Explore carefully designed levels, facing a variety of monstrous enemies. Build a powerful deck of cards, scavenge vital items, and race against time to escape. But be warned: the horrors you encounter may shatter your sanity before you can complete your mission.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517330?t=1761770687","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517330?t=1761770687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517330/d6e6df829af2bbe53949d3c756f7c7bc6d44401a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761770687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517330/d6e6df829af2bbe53949d3c756f7c7bc6d44401a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761770687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the labyrinthine depths of Veilwalkers, where survival is a desperate dance with madness and monsters. As a recruit for a shadowy government agency, you must explore these meticulously handcrafted dungeons to uncover powerful artifacts. These artifacts serve as the currency of this dark world, allowin